title: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › Decision banners
route: /authorizations/new/referral/RF-2053?draft=draft-1001
intro: The one banner between the header and the document. It says where the referral stands in words and offers the next step as a button. Only the most important one shows (declined, accepted, coverage lapsed, waiting on the referrer, findings), so the page has one alert at a time. On the Coverage and Fit tabs, which carry their own headline, and on the Validation tab, which lists the findings, the banner that points at that tab steps aside.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Open the full referral page"
decision d1 "Which banner is the most important one that applies?"

group gDec "Declined"
  toast t1 "Red banner 'Declined: Needs a higher level of care'\nThe note, then 'A courtesy reply went to the referrer.'\nor 'No reply was sent to the referrer.'"
  click c1 "Click 'Reopen'"
  store st1 "Referral is In review again"
endgroup

group gAcc "Decided and moving on"
  toast t2 "Green banner 'Accepted into IOP' (or 'Admitted into IOP')\n'Target admission 10/21/2026. Owner Taylor Brooks.'\nScheduled adds 'Intake visit Thu 9:00 am'"
  decision d2 "Did this referral start a request?"
  toast t3 "'Linked request R-1042' with its status chip\nbutton 'Open R-1042'"
  click c2 "Click 'Open R-1042' or the link 'R-1042'"
  toast t4 "'No request is linked yet. Continue with this referral to build the authorization for this patient.'"
  click c3 "Click 'Continue with this referral'\n(not shown once Admitted)"
  process p1 "Uses the case in the address, or starts a new one\nReferral goes into the case\nAsks 'Attach this referral?' first when the agents already ran"
endgroup

group gOpen "Open referral"
  toast t5 "Amber banner 'Waiting on the referrer'\n'You asked … by fax Mon 2:10 pm. Reader reads the reply as soon as it arrives. For the demo, open More and choose 'Demo: simulate the referrer's reply'.'"
  toast t6 "Amber banner 'Reader found 3 things to check'\nThe problems in a sentence. Only while New or In review"
  click c4 "Click 'Review findings'"
  process p2 "Validation tab opens"
  toast t7 "Red banner 'Verify found that coverage has lapsed'\n'Fix this before billing. Ask the referrer about a renewal or a new plan.'"
  click c5 "Click 'Open coverage'"
  process p3 "Coverage tab opens"
endgroup

goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › Full page: Validation tab"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › Check coverage"
goto g3 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › Accept a referral\n(attach the referral, then Intake)"
goto g4 "Continues in: Dashboard\nOpens request R-1042"
end e1 "No banner\nA New or In review referral with no open findings and no lapsed coverage"

s1 --> d1
d1 -->|Declined| t1 --> c1 --> st1
d1 -->|Accepted, Scheduled, Admitted| t2 --> d2
d2 -->|Yes| t3 --> c2 --> g4
d2 -->|No| t4 --> c3 --> p1 --> g3
d1 -->|Awaiting info| t5
d1 -->|Open findings| t6 --> c4 --> p2 --> g1
d1 -->|Coverage lapsed| t7 --> c5 --> p3 --> g2
d1 -->|Nothing to say| e1
